00:01:23.686 --> 00:01:27.013
Alright, first of all,
Halloween encourages children

00:01:27.097 --> 00:01:31.696
to be bigger piles of hot
garbage than they already are.

00:01:31.696 --> 00:01:34.271
What kind of shit holiday teaches children

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:37.976
it's OK to come to my door
and ask for free food.

00:01:38.204 --> 00:01:40.811
Any other day, if a kid
came to my door asking

00:01:40.811 --> 00:01:43.193
