00:01:43.492 --> 00:01:44.991
I'd mace 'em right in the face.

00:01:45.534 --> 00:01:46.994
Right in the chubby little face.

00:01:46.994 --> 00:01:49.558
I don't care how old you are.

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:52.077
You want candy, why don't you get a job.

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:53.665
Then you go down to the CVS

00:01:53.949 --> 00:01:55.789
and look the cashier right in the face

00:01:55.796 --> 00:01:59.086
while you buy a whole bag of
jumbo Kit Kats for yourself.

00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:01.784
Alright? That's how adults get candy.

00:02:01.784 --> 00:02:04.209
Why don't you try that instead.

00:02:04.771 --> 00:02:06.850
Next, bite-sized candy.

00:02:07.055 --> 00:02:09.563
Whoever invented bite-sized
candy probably invented

00:02:09.563 --> 00:02:12.130
