00:02:23.237 --> 00:02:24.274
Huh?

00:02:24.449 --> 00:02:25.319
Not this one.

00:02:25.319 --> 00:02:26.225
Not today.

00:02:26.225 --> 00:02:27.947
Give your big candy bar

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:30.493
