free food hierarchy, not down.

00:02:42.658 --> 00:02:44.178
How about a nice glazed ham

00:02:44.428 --> 00:02:46.290
with side of mashed sweet potatoes.

00:02:46.428 --> 00:02:48.129
Huh? Have you even thought about that?

00:02:48.159 --> 00:02:49.459
Instead of your penny.

00:02:49.459 --> 00:02:52.383
How about a warm jambalaya?

00:02:52.634 --> 00:02:52.897
