00:03:00.662 --> 00:03:02.652
That's where I get my apples from.

00:03:02.693 --> 00:03:04.803
Next, Halloween parties.

00:03:05.025 --> 00:03:09.365
Halloween parties are as
wet, disgusting, sweaty,

00:03:09.365 --> 00:03:12.214
