00:03:25.634 --> 00:03:27.756
to tickle some Laffy Taffys.

00:03:28.181 --> 00:03:29.927
Just rubbing around their pieces of candy

00:03:29.927 --> 00:03:30.995
around one another.

00:03:30.995 --> 00:03:34.002
If I wanted to watch Dora The Explorer,

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.784
grind upon Spongebob Squarepants,

00:03:36.784 --> 00:03:38.553
I'd go right on the internet.

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:41.512
You find that, you find
that right on the internet.

00:03:41.679 --> 00:03:42.818
Alright? I've seen it.

00:03:42.818 --> 00:03:45.230
I don't need to see that in person.

00:03:45.254 --> 00:03:46.740
That's disgusting.

00:03:47.595 --> 00:03:50.046
Also, bros who try too hard

00:03:50.076 --> 00:03:53.693
